-- Supabase Oct 30 2026 Data API grant backfill (owner-approved 10-20)
-- Context: Supabase stops auto-granting Data API access to new public tables on 2026-10-30.
-- This migration replays the live prod grant snapshot (taken 2026-10-20) so schema rebuilds
-- (supabase db reset, preview branches, new projects) keep working after that date.
-- Idempotent no-op on live prod: every statement below matches what is already granted.
-- Standing rule going forward: every new CREATE TABLE migration must include explicit GRANTs.

